<title>FRANCE: Broker upgrades Sita shares.</title>
<headline>Broker upgrades Sita shares.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>French brokerage Delahaye said it raised its rating on the stock of Lyonnaise des Eaux subsidiary Sita to neutral from underperform after the cleaning and waste disposal firm reported a 10.2 percent rise in 1996 net profit.</p>
<p>Delahaye said Sita should do better in 1997 and noted its stock has been lagging the market for some time.</p>
<p>Sita shares were down 1.73 percent at 1,082 francs at 1215 GMT. The bourse's CAC-40 index was up four points or 0.18 percent.</p>
</text>
